      "writtenOn": "2024-09-16T19:09:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There isn\u0027t an external way someone can check to see someone is a committer or not.\n\nThe closest/most useful alternative would probably be to just pick people from OWNERS files, as all owners are supposed to be committers (and probably held to an even higher bar than committers).",
      "parentUuid": "b1c8b182_f841206d",
      "revId": "20fbd154032146429b7c19b10ab904eaf3cead2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
