      "writtenOn": "2024-09-16T19:15:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately I don\u0027t think the requirement that OWNERS be committers is enforced. I have experienced getting a CL reviewed by the owner only to realize I still needed two committers because the owner wasn\u0027t one. That was maybe a year or so ago though, perhaps additional enforcement has been added?",
      "parentUuid": "61790741_99f895c8",
      "revId": "20fbd154032146429b7c19b10ab904eaf3cead2a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
