      "writtenOn": "2024-09-16T19:21:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m honestly not sure. I know for a long time it wasn\u0027t enforced, but we have some sort of automated auditing process going on now and I think that might be enforcing it. At any rate, even if it isn\u0027t foolproof, it\u0027s going to work nearly all of the time. If we can find places where non-committers are owners, those are bugs that should be fixed immediately.",
